399389-06:00, done=true, story_Points=7}, ToDoItem{id=82, title='Java and Springboot Study', moduleId=41, description='Study about the technologies that are going to be necessary to develop the final solution for the client. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=2, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=4, actualTime=null, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:49:35.489336-06:00, done=false, story_Points=7}, ToDoItem{id=83, title='Initial code deployment.', moduleId=41, description='Time to understand the code provided by oracle and do the initial code deployment in order to understand all the OCI concepts studied. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=4, actualTime=5, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:50:06.709560-06:00, done=true, story_Points=8}]}, Module{id=42, title='Getting Close To Oracle', body='Sprint to Start the initial phase of the development process', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-04-05, dateLimit=2025-04-19, parentModule=null, tasks=[ToDoItem{id=89, title='Select the change to do for first period.', moduleId=42, description='Time to analyze the code provided by ORACLE and identify the opportunity areas that this can have. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:54:39.768315-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=85, title='Initial task and responsabilities distribution.', moduleId=42, description='Time to start the initial distribution of responsibilities like do the initial code deployment, do the figma, start the documentation of these initial phases, etc. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=1, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:51:16.386314-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=88, title='Development of Figma', moduleId=42, description='Create a Figma that matches the design of the project we aim to develop for Oracle', dateLimit=null, responsible=4, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=4, creation_ts=2025-04-0